{
  "id": 1037,
  "name": "super-lure",
  "fling_power": 30,
  "fling_effect": null,
  "attributes": [],
  "category": {
    "name": "spelunking",
    "url": "/api/v2/item-category/11/"
  },
  "effect_entries": [],
  "flavor_text_entries": [
    {
      "text": "つかうと　めずらしい　ポケモンが\nでて　きやすく　なる　こうすい。\nむしよせコロンより　ながく　もつ。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "lets-go-pikachu-lets-go-eevee",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/19/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "사용하면 희귀한 포켓몬이\n나오기 쉬워지는 향수.\n벌레유인코롱보다 효과가 오래간다.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "lets-go-pikachu-lets-go-eevee",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/19/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "使用後，讓稀有寶可夢\n變得容易出現的香水。\n效果比引蟲香水更持久。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "lets-go-pikachu-lets-go-eevee",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/19/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hant",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/4/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Une substance qui fait apparaître les Pokémon rares\nplus facilement pendant une durée plus longue que\nle Parfum.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "lets-go-pikachu-lets-go-eevee",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/19/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Ein Parfüm, das für kurze Zeit vermehrt\nseltene Pokémon erscheinen lässt.\nWirkt länger als das Item Lockparfüm.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "lets-go-pikachu-lets-go-eevee",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/19/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Colonia que atrae a los Pokémon raros y cuyo efecto\nes algo más duradero que el de la Colonia.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "lets-go-pikachu-lets-go-eevee",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/19/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Profumo che attira Pokémon rari.\nIl suo effetto dura più a lungo di quello\ndel Profumo invito.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "lets-go-pikachu-lets-go-eevee",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/19/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "A glass bottle of perfume that makes rare Pokémon\nmore likely to appear. It lasts longer than a Lure.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "lets-go-pikachu-lets-go-eevee",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/19/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "使うと　珍しい　ポケモンが\n出て　きやすく　なる　香水。\nむしよせコロンより　長く　もつ。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "lets-go-pikachu-lets-go-eevee",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/19/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ja",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/11/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "使用该香水后，\n稀有宝可梦会更容易出现。\n效果比引虫香水更持久。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "lets-go-pikachu-lets-go-eevee",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/19/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hans",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/12/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Colonia que atrae a los Pokémon raros y cuyo efecto\nes algo más duradero que el de la Colonia.",
